ons\" or \"a threefold hypostasis.\" This latter seems to be the true account of the matter. See an interesting note in Newman, Arians of the Fourth Century, Appendix IV"},{"id":"df5a76d3ab79","b":"ISA","v":"npnf.hieronymus.epistulae","w":"hieronymus.epistulae","a":"hieronymus","s":18,"p":[4,4],"r":[8,1],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"An allusion to \"Maher-shalal-hash-baz,\" Isa. 8:1"},{"id":"d05527e1e30f","b":"DEU","v":"npnf.hieronymus.epistulae","w":"hieronymus.epistulae","a":"hieronymus","s":18,"p":[8,8],"r":[23,4],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Deut. 23:3 - Jerome substitutes \"fourteenth\" for \"tenth.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"d36a37e5f5f9","b":"PSA","v":"npnf.hieronymus.epistulae","w":"hieronymus.epistulae","a":"hieronymus","s":18,"p":[18,18],"r":[39,7],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Ps. 39:6, Vulg. That is, who knows that the world is vanity","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"da0802529b34","b":"MAT","v":"npnf.hieronymus.epistulae","w":"hieronymus.epistulae","a":"hieronymus","s":18,"p":[21,21],"r":[10,10],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Matt. 10:10. According to Letter XXIII. these typify dead works"},{"id":"64676b2faf5c","b":"ECC","v":"npnf.hieronymus.epistulae","w":"hieronymus.epistulae","a":"hieronymus","s":18,"p":[30,30],"r":[10,4],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Eccles. 10:4, A.V., \"the spirit of the ruler."},{"id":"cb9a13fe89e2","b":"PSA","v":"npnf.hieronymus.epistulae","w":"hieronymus.epistulae","a":"hieronymus","s":18,"p":[31,31],"r":[53,6],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Ps. 53:5, according to the Roman Psalter","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"4e0da3a5b74f","b":"LAM","v":"npnf.hieronymus.epistulae","w":"hieronymus.epistulae","a":"hieronymus","s":18,"p"